 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nHelvetia Präzision AG                                         MASTER SERVICES\nIndustriestrasse 55, 1201 Genève, Switzerland                           AGREEMENT\nMWST-Nr: CHE-186.671.510 MWST\nReg No: CH-746222\n\nFROM                                                             BEZAHLT [circled]\nHelvetia Präzision AG                                            RECHNUNGSADRESSE\nIndustriestrasse 55                                              Alpina Medical SA\n1201 Genève                                                      Industriestrasse 55\nSwitzerland                                                      1201 Genève\nVAT: CHE-186.671.510 MWST                                        Switzerland\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 06.05.2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Helvetia Präzision AG, with its registered office at Industriestrasse 55, Genève (\"Party A\"), and Alpina Medical\nSA, with its registered office at Industriestrasse 55, Genève (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Helvetia Präzision AG / Marc Dubois\nParty B   Alpina Medical SA / Claudia Frei\nDate      06.05.2026",
